ig id="fig3" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Echocardiogram shows a mass on the RVOT with association to the pulmonic valve (arrow).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.ID2013-519720.003"/></fig><fig id="fig4" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Transesophageal echocardiogram showing a pulsatile mass at the pulmonic valve.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CRIM.ID2013-519720.004"/></fig></floats-group></article>